:: Bloomshore District
<<initPlayState>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-district", "Bloomshore District")>>\
<<if Player.isYounger()>>\
You are in the Bloomshore District. You live here with <<Caleb>> and grandma, not far from Linkon University's campus.
<<else>>\
You are in the Bloomshore District. Quiet streets lead toward Linkon University's campus and the homes nearby.
<</if>>

